---
layout: layouts/base.njk
ctaYashir: true
title: "Kontakt"
description: "Hamkor marketing agentligi bilan bog'laning. Termiz shahri. Bepul audit uchun ariza qoldiring."
permalink: "/kontakt/"
---
<section class="hero">
    <div class="wrap">
      <span class="eyebrow">Kontakt</span>
      <h1>Bog'lanish</h1>
      <p class="lead">Qo'ng'iroq qiling, Telegramga yozing yoki quyidagi formani to'ldiring. Ish kunlari 1 kun ichida javob beramiz.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="band band--cream">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="split">
        <div class="lockup">
          <h2>Ma'lumotlar</h2>
          <div class="rule"></div>
          <p class="sub">Termiz shahri</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <div class="contact-list reveal">
            <div class="row">
              <span class="k">Telefon</span>
              <span class="v"><a href="tel:{{ site.telefon_raqam }}">{{ site.telefon }}</a></span>
            </div>
            <div class="row">
              <span class="k">Telegram</span>
              <span class="v"><a href="https://t.me/+998888210200" target="_blank" rel="noopener">t.me/+998888210200</a></span>
            </div>
            <div class="row">
              <span class="k">Manzil</span>
              <span class="v">Termiz shahri, Surxondaryo viloyati</span>
            </div>
            <div class="row">
              <span class="k">Ish vaqti</span>
              <span class="v">Dushanba–Shanba, 09:00–18:00</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Xarita: aniq manzil bo'lgach, Google Maps'dan "Share → Embed a map"
               orqali olingan iframe kodini shu yerga qo'ying. -->
          <div class="map reveal">
            <iframe
              title="Hamkor marketing agentligi — Termiz"
              src="https://www.google.com/maps?q=Termiz,%20Surxondaryo,%20O'zbekiston&output=embed"
              loading="lazy"
              referrerpolicy="no-referrer-when-downgrade"></iframe>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="band band--green" id="konsultatsiya">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="split">
        <div>
          <div class="lockup">
            <h2>Bepul audit</h2>
            <div class="rule"></div>
            <p class="sub">Javob beramiz — 1 ish kuni ichida</p>
          </div>
          <p class="lead" style="color: var(--on-green-mute)">Audit 40–60 daqiqa davom etadi. Biznesingiz, hozirgi reklama xarajati va sotuv jarayonini ko'rib chiqamiz, so'ng bir nechta aniq tavsiya beramiz. To'lov yo'q, shartnoma talab qilinmaydi.</p>
        </div>

        {% include "partials/form.njk" %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
